# ChangeLog file for devel
# This file is updated with Maddlog

* Fri Nov  6 2026 Sjoerd Mullender <sjoerd@acm.org>
- In Dec2025-SP4, the MonetDB-geom module was accidentally not built for
  Fedora and RHEL 9 and 10.  This has been corrected.  The module cannot
  be built for RHEL 8 since the required geos library is too old.

* Fri Oct 23 2026 Sjoerd Mullender <sjoerd@acm.org>
- Added an option --relative-dir to mclient to specify the directory
  for relative path names when using the ON CLIENT option in SQL queries.

